          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="br b--black-10 pa3">
            $0.0018 per extra request <span tooltip="If you exhaust your included monthly quota you will be charged for extras."><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
          <td class="pa3">
            <strong>$0.0009</strong> per extra request <span tooltip="If you exhaust your included monthly quota you will be charged for extras."><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="br b--black-10 pv3">
            No uptime SLA
          </td>
          <td class="pv3">
            <strong>99.95% uptime SLA</strong> <span tooltip="We guarantee the API will be available 99.95% of the time."><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="br b--black-10 pt3 pb4">
            <strong>Email support</strong> <span tooltip="Email or chat with us during US and European working hours."><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
          <td class="pt3 pb4">
            <strong>Priority email support</strong> <span tooltip="Your support requests are placed at the top of the pile and are answered as soon as possible, usually within an hour during US and European working hours."><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="flex">
      <a class="f5 dib ba no-underline ph4 pv3 br2 grow white bg-na-blue w-50 tc gs" href="/register?plan=1">Start with Business</a>
      <a class="f5 dib ba no-underline ph4 pv3 br2 grow white w-50 tc gs" style="background:#af53e4;" href="/register?plan=1">Start with Advanced</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Enterprise -->
  <div class="mb3 w-25-l">
    <div class="ba br2 b--black-10">
      <table class="w-100">
        <tr>
          <td style="vertical-align:top;">
            <div class="flex-l pa3 tc tl-l" style="border-bottom:2px solid #ebb312;">
              <img src="/images/star.png" class="mr3-l" style="height:50px; width:50px;"/>
              <div>
                <h2 class="fw3 ma0-l mv3">Enterprise</h2>
                <div class="f2 mv2"><span style="font-size:2rem">Contact us</span></div>
                <div class="f6">&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="bb b--black-10 v-top">
            <p class="lh-copy ma0 pa3">For enterprise projects that require premium data or bespoke solutions.</p>
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="lh-title ph2 pb3 pt4">
            Access to <strong>extra articles and <br />an extended source library</strong> <span tooltip="Over 1M+ articles a day. And if we are not already tracking a source that you need, we will add it especially for you"><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="lh-title pv3">
            Articles are enriched with <strong>20 additional data-points</strong> <span tooltip="All results contain the following extra data points: AI generated summary, SEO rank, all embedded links from the article, front page article tagging, topics, ORG PER &amp; LOC entities, IPTC IAB &amp; custom taxonomy, title and content sentiment, related stories, and journalist information"><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="pv3">
            Article &amp; story clustering
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="lh-title pt3 pb4">
            Custom classifications, tagging,<br />&amp; information extraction
          </td>
        </tr>

        <!--<tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="pt3 pb4" colspan="2">
              Caching for identical requests <span tooltip="If you make identical requests within a 5 minute window (example: from multiple clients or users) we serve from a cache and don't deduct from your monthly requests."><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:16px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
      </tr>-->

        <tr class="bt b--black-10 tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="lh-title pb3 pt4 v-mid" style="height:100px">
            <strong>Unlimited</strong> requests
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="pv3">
            Add sources on demand
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="lt-title pv3">
            <strong>Custom SLA &amp; dedicated chat</strong> <span tooltip="Dedicated Slack and Teams rooms to converse directly with our team."><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="tc bg-na-grey-1">
          <td class="pt3 pb4">
            <strong>On-premise deployment</strong> <span tooltip="For projects with a high security requirement we can deploy an API server on-site."><i class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px;">help</i></span>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div>
      <a class="f5 db ba no-underline ph4 pv3 br2 grow white tc gs" style="background:#ebb312;" href="/quote">Get a quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

